# Striatum Codex Plugin (v{striatum_version})

Generated by `striatum plugin install --profile codex`.

## Install

```
codex plugin marketplace add ./.striatum/plugins/
```

Then enable via `@striatum` from inside Codex.

User-scope: pass `--scope user` at generation to write under
`~/.codex/plugins/striatum/`.

## Layout

- `.codex-plugin/plugin.json` — Codex plugin manifest
- `skills/striatum-*/SKILL.md` — six skills
- `commands/*.md` — five slash commands
- `hooks/hooks.json` — empty hooks
- `.mcp.json` — empty MCP server placeholder
- `.manifest.json` — Striatum-side regeneration manifest
